<title>ITALY: Italy cabinet approves Autostrade sell-off report.</title>
<headline>Italy cabinet approves Autostrade sell-off report.</headline>
<dateline>ROME 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Italian cabinet has approved a report on motorway operator Autostrade by Treasury Minister Carlo Azeglio Ciampi concerning the criteria for the group's privatisation.</p>
<p>The prime minister's under-secretary, Enrico Micheli, said in a note that the Autostrade report will now be presented to appropriate parliamentary commissions. The privatisation of Autostrade is planned by June.</p>
<p>-- Milan newsroom +392 66129502</p>
</text>
